      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَازَوْا</span></b>  <i>They enjoined</i> [or <i>exhorted</i>] <i>one another
to be patient,</i> or <i>enduring,</i> or <i>to have comely
patience.</i> (K, TA.) [And hence, <i>They consoled
one another.</i>]

